{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51651","headline":"九日同羣僚登高（幷序） · 钱鏐","name":"九日同羣僚登高（幷序）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淡荡晴晖杂素光，碧峯遥衬白云长。\n好看塞雁归南浦，宜听砧声捣夕阳。\n满野旌旗皆动色，千株橘柚尽含芳。\n锦袍分赐功臣後，因向龙山醉羽觞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱鏐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51651.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51651","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}